Roles & Permissions (/setup/roles)
Purpose: Define and manage system access control
Contents:
Pre-defined system roles list: 
oSuper Admin (Diocese Council)
oDiocese Administrator
oRegional Overseer
oRegional Team Member
oSubregion Overseer
oSubregion Team Member
oPastor (Church Admin)
oChurch Council Member
oChurch Secretary
oChurch Treasurer
oChurch Youth Leader
oView-Only User
Add custom role button
Role creation/edit form: 
oRole name
oRole description
oOrganization level (Diocese/Region/Subregion/Church/All)
oRole status (Active/Inactive)
Permission matrix (table view): 
oModules listed in rows
oPermissions in columns (View/Create/Edit/Delete/Approve)
oCheckboxes for each permission per module
o"Select All" functionality per module
Module categories for permissions: 
oDashboard & Analytics
oDemographics Management
oFinancial Management (Tithe, Budget, Allocation, Income, Expenses)
oInitiatives Management
oEvents Management
oCommunications
oReports & Analytics
oUser Management
oSystem Settings
Permission inheritance visualization (how permissions flow)
Role assignment history
Users per role count
Role analytics (most used permissions)
Clone role functionality
Export role configuration
Permission testing tool (test what a role can see/do)

Compliance Requirements Configuration (/setup/compliance)
Purpose: Set mandatory reporting and data submission rules
Contents:
Compliance rules dashboard: 
oActive compliance rules count
oChurches in compliance percentage
oRecent compliance violations
Add new compliance rule button
Compliance rule creation form: 
oRule name
oRule description
oRule category (Demographics/Financial/Events/Other)
oRequired data fields (multi-select): 
Total members count
Youth count
Women's fellowship count
Men's fellowship count
Baptisms this month
Communion participation
New conversions
Monthly income
Tithe payment
Expense summary
oSubmission frequency (Monthly/Quarterly/Annually)
oSubmission deadline (day of month)
oGrace period (days after deadline)
oApplies to (All Churches/Specific Region/Specific Subregion)
oRule status (Active/Inactive)
oConsequence of non-compliance (Alert Only/Escalation/Report to Bishop)
Validation rules configuration: 
oData type validation
oRange validation (min/max values)
oCross-field validation (e.g., youth count ≤ total members)
oMandatory field indicators
Automatic reminder settings: 
oReminder schedule (days before deadline)
oReminder method (SMS/Email/Both)
oReminder recipients (Pastor/Church Council/Overseer)
oEscalation reminders for overdue submissions
Compliance exceptions management: 
oRequest exception functionality
oException approval workflow
oTemporary exemption reasons
oException expiration dates
Compliance reporting: 
oCompliance rate by church
oCompliance rate by region/subregion
oCompliance trends over time
oNon-compliant churches list
oExport compliance reports

Financial Configuration (/setup/financial)
Purpose: Configure financial rules and parameters
Contents:
Tithe configuration: 
oDefault tithe percentage (e.g., 10%)
oTithe calculation method (Gross Income/Net Income)
oTithe payment deadline (day of month)
oGrace period for late payments
oLate payment penalties (if any)
oTithe exemption rules
Budget cycle configuration: 
oFiscal year start month
oBudget approval workflow
oBudget revision periods
oBudget reporting frequency
Allocation configuration: 
oAllocation categories (Pastoral Support/Building/Training/Emergency)
oAllocation approval thresholds
oAllocation request workflow
oAllocation criteria setup
oAllocation formula builder (based on members, income, location, etc.)
Financial reporting configuration: 
oRequired financial reports
oFinancial report submission deadlines
oFinancial report approval workflow
oFinancial statement templates
Expense categories: 
oChurch-level expense categories
oSubregion-level expense categories
oRegional-level expense categories
oDiocese-level expense categories
oAdd/edit/delete expense categories
Income categories: 
oOffering types (Sunday, Midweek, Special)
oFundraising categories
oDonation categories
oOther income sources
oAdd/edit/delete income categories
Currency and exchange rate settings: 
oSupported currencies list
oManual exchange rate entry
oExchange rate update frequency
oDefault currency per region/store
oMulti-currency transaction handling

Communication Settings (/setup/communication)
Purpose: Configure SMS and email communication
Contents:
SMS gateway configuration: 
oSMS provider selection
oAPI credentials setup
oSender ID configuration
oSMS balance monitoring
oSMS pricing per message
oSMS delivery reports
Email configuration: 
oSMTP server settings
oSender email address
oEmail display name
oEmail signature template
oEmail delivery tracking
Message templates: 
oCompliance reminder template
oTithe reminder template
oEvent invitation template
oReport approval template
oGeneral announcement template
oCustom template builder
oTemplate variables (dynamic fields)
oTemplate preview functionality
Communication rules: 
oMessage scheduling options
oBulk messaging limits
oOpt-out management
oSpam prevention rules
oMessage priority levels
Notification preferences: 
oDefault notification methods per role
oNotification frequency settings
oQuiet hours configuration
oEmergency notification bypass
Communication logs: 
oAll sent messages log
oDelivery status tracking
oFailed message retry mechanism
oMessage cost tracking

